WEBVTT

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:26.916
MISSION 10: FATE

00:01:34.583 --> 00:01:35.625
Why are you back here?

00:01:35.708 --> 00:01:39.041
This is where I can see
Chairman Jiang's beautified look.

00:01:42.708 --> 00:01:45.250
The Heaven Lily Clan surely has
an amazing tour-de-force.

00:01:45.625 --> 00:01:48.416
That explains why you refused
to leave with me.

00:01:48.500 --> 00:01:51.458
Quan, it's not what you think it is.

00:01:51.833 --> 00:01:54.250
I knew you'd say that.

00:01:54.583 --> 00:01:56.208
And I'm sick of it!

00:02:02.791 --> 00:02:04.375
He has launched into the air.

00:02:08.125 --> 00:02:10.541
It turns out the White Lily Purity Blast
is the Blood Demon's worst enemy.

00:02:36.958 --> 00:02:40.208
Quan, you'll die if you resist
the White Lily Purity Blast like this.

00:03:13.125 --> 00:03:14.250
Quan.

00:03:14.916 --> 00:03:16.458
I hurt you before.

00:03:17.166 --> 00:03:18.625
I hurt my master too.

00:03:20.916 --> 00:03:23.000
Now I just want to exorcise
the demon in you.

00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:26.500
I can even transfer
my White Lily Pure Qi to you

00:03:26.583 --> 00:03:28.458
as long as you quit the dark arts.

00:03:31.333 --> 00:03:32.375
I don't need your pity.

00:03:33.041 --> 00:03:35.750
The only dark arts around here
is from your Heaven Lily Clan.

00:03:36.666 --> 00:03:38.875
It even suppressed
our emotions and desires.

00:03:38.958 --> 00:03:42.708
But how do people thrive without emotions?

00:03:56.208 --> 00:03:59.458
I haven't practiced for so long,
so my mystical powers won't last.

00:04:14.500 --> 00:04:15.458
Master.

00:04:15.750 --> 00:04:16.750
Keep out of this.

00:04:17.375 --> 00:04:20.291
<i>There's so much energy
in this beef offal seller.</i>

00:04:21.125 --> 00:04:22.625
<i>And it's immeasurable.</i>

00:04:24.750 --> 00:04:26.541
Transform!

00:04:45.083 --> 00:04:49.208
I haven't absorbed such tremendous energy
in a long time.

00:04:54.625 --> 00:04:56.500
He's getting stronger.

00:04:56.791 --> 00:04:58.416
Just because I went easy on him.

00:04:59.000 --> 00:05:01.916
Redtooth's strength is based on
his ability to siphon blood

00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:04.833
to transfer his enemies' energy
into his body.

00:05:05.166 --> 00:05:08.750
So the stronger the enemy he bites,
the stronger he himself becomes.

00:05:09.666 --> 00:05:12.375
So Seven has so much energy in himself.

00:05:12.458 --> 00:05:14.875
Yet that isn't his full strength.

00:05:19.375 --> 00:05:20.333
Xiao Fei, no!

00:05:23.166 --> 00:05:24.708
You have plenty of energy.

00:05:24.791 --> 00:05:28.125
But without the speed,
you're just a pile of wasted flesh.

00:05:33.708 --> 00:05:34.583
Xiao Fei!

00:06:08.875 --> 00:06:10.166
Senior.

00:06:10.666 --> 00:06:13.083
If you don't lift the seal for me,

00:06:13.833 --> 00:06:16.333
I'll suck him dry of his blood.

00:06:19.375 --> 00:06:21.250
Get up, young man.

00:06:21.416 --> 00:06:24.000
But my legs are trembling.

00:06:26.875 --> 00:06:27.791
Xiao Fei.

00:06:29.083 --> 00:06:30.250
Dai Bo.

00:06:34.666 --> 00:06:37.166
<i>You're feeling helpless right now,
aren't you?</i>

00:06:37.750 --> 00:06:41.291
<i>All you can do is stare blankly
at those around you being killed.</i>

00:06:48.250 --> 00:06:50.708
You've been looking for me, aren't you?

00:06:53.083 --> 00:06:57.333
Retrieve me and you'll be
the world's best assassin.

00:07:01.708 --> 00:07:03.791
But I don't want to be an assassin.

00:07:04.666 --> 00:07:08.083
You can't choose because I am you.

00:07:09.000 --> 00:07:13.791
So I may not forsake my past
and start a new life?

00:07:17.375 --> 00:07:20.041
To be a cursed Shadow Killer,

00:07:21.125 --> 00:07:24.708
that is my fate and also yours.

00:07:25.666 --> 00:07:27.583
Don't I get a chance to choose?

00:07:28.416 --> 00:07:31.333
No one can break away from their past.

00:07:32.750 --> 00:07:35.500
<i>No one can break away from their fate.</i>

00:07:39.208 --> 00:07:41.416
<i>If you do not let your emotions
get the better of you,</i>

00:07:42.291 --> 00:07:44.791
<i>then basically no one can defeat you.</i>

00:07:57.875 --> 00:07:59.666
<i>What was that dreadful feeling?</i>

00:08:05.375 --> 00:08:06.875
It's you.

00:08:10.083 --> 00:08:14.875
The world's most dignified assassin
had been selling beef offal around here.

00:08:15.416 --> 00:08:17.666
For someone of your caliber, I say...

00:08:18.791 --> 00:08:20.041
Go to hell!

00:08:27.625 --> 00:08:29.166
It's you again.

00:08:29.583 --> 00:08:33.416
Every time I'm about to kill him,
you just have to show up.

00:08:33.833 --> 00:08:35.375
A pain in my ass.

00:08:35.458 --> 00:08:36.708
Don't get me wrong.

00:08:36.833 --> 00:08:39.125
I'm only here to witness a wonderful duel.

00:08:39.208 --> 00:08:40.041
SEVEN

00:08:51.041 --> 00:08:52.458
Thousand Demon Daggers?

00:08:54.041 --> 00:08:55.291
Just in time.

00:08:55.583 --> 00:08:59.333
Let's settle the score
we've put off for six years.

00:08:59.416 --> 00:09:02.750
A fight between Shadow Killers
is not for the public eye.

00:09:03.958 --> 00:09:05.500
So let me clear the space for you.

00:09:25.083 --> 00:09:26.583
My master activated a force field.

00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:29.000
So no one is to meddle in this fight.

00:09:29.708 --> 00:09:31.000
It's destroying the park.

00:09:31.083 --> 00:09:34.291
How much should I fine for this?

00:09:44.875 --> 00:09:47.041
Emotions only make you weak.

00:09:47.375 --> 00:09:48.541
Pick up the sword

00:09:48.916 --> 00:09:51.375
and revive the true Shadow Killer in you.

00:10:07.666 --> 00:10:10.666
SEVEN

00:10:45.250 --> 00:10:46.916
Your Thousand Demon Daggers

00:10:47.541 --> 00:10:50.208
is hardly effective against me.

00:10:50.291 --> 00:10:52.458
He's too different from two years ago.

00:10:52.708 --> 00:10:55.250
And that's not the way to use the sword.

00:11:08.833 --> 00:11:12.708
I've read <i>A Collection of
Stylish Hairstyles</i> hundreds of times.

00:11:13.333 --> 00:11:15.916
It's not really a book about hairstyles.

00:11:16.083 --> 00:11:17.375
In fact, it is...

00:11:17.458 --> 00:11:21.041
I told you, it's a secret book
about Xuanwu martial arts.

00:11:25.583 --> 00:11:27.750
Zhangmen, you're back.

00:11:28.708 --> 00:11:30.416
Xuanwu is boring.

00:11:30.500 --> 00:11:34.083
Nothing but bloodbaths
and no one to give me a haircut.

00:11:36.500 --> 00:11:38.541
<i>Listen to me, young man.</i>

00:11:38.625 --> 00:11:40.833
<i>That's not the way to do a haircut.</i>

00:11:40.916 --> 00:11:43.125
<i>Your qi is all over the place.</i>

00:11:43.208 --> 00:11:45.791
<i>You must concentrate your qi
on the tip of the crown.</i>

00:11:45.875 --> 00:11:48.291
<i>That way, you'll cut through the air...</i>

00:11:49.458 --> 00:11:52.250
I'm not the Shadow Killer
you keep talking about.

00:11:53.083 --> 00:11:59.375
Rather, I'm the strongest barber
on this island!

00:12:10.166 --> 00:12:12.541
Blood Demon Defense.

00:12:49.041 --> 00:12:50.375
Redtooth has won.

00:13:08.791 --> 00:13:11.916
<i>Shit, he even dodged that.</i>

00:13:12.541 --> 00:13:15.625
<i>And I'm almost out of strength.</i>

00:13:16.625 --> 00:13:18.625
<i>I can't even lift my hands.</i>

00:13:19.333 --> 00:13:20.958
You can't defeat me.

00:13:22.000 --> 00:13:26.250
All I need is a bite of you
and I'll be fully healed.

00:13:29.041 --> 00:13:31.291
Your strength is running thin.

00:13:36.458 --> 00:13:38.500
But you forgot one thing.

00:13:39.875 --> 00:13:43.250
There's one more person
who seeks to kill you.

00:13:56.041 --> 00:13:57.625
If you kill me,

00:13:58.416 --> 00:14:01.125
how will you explain it to the chief?

00:14:03.208 --> 00:14:04.583
The next one to die...

00:14:20.416 --> 00:14:23.166
You're unable to defeat me
at your current strength.

00:14:23.750 --> 00:14:25.041
Redtooth is dead.

00:14:25.208 --> 00:14:27.375
The organization will send in
even more assassins

00:14:27.458 --> 00:14:28.500
to wipe out everyone on this island.

00:14:29.833 --> 00:14:31.833
There's only one way for you to save them.

00:14:46.000 --> 00:14:47.041
Quan.

00:14:57.500 --> 00:15:01.291
I don't believe it, Seven killed Redtooth.

00:15:04.041 --> 00:15:05.250
But how?

00:15:13.875 --> 00:15:15.791
DAI BO J HAIR SALON

00:15:15.875 --> 00:15:17.416
Can I have this cut?

00:15:29.666 --> 00:15:31.916
BILL: 40,000 YUAN

00:15:32.000 --> 00:15:34.000
BEEF OFFAL

00:15:37.125 --> 00:15:40.583
It's 500 for 5,000? Isn't that too much?

00:15:47.208 --> 00:15:50.041
SEVEN

00:15:51.291 --> 00:15:53.666
IMPERIAL BODYGUARD
SUPER SCISSORS COUPON

00:15:55.875 --> 00:15:59.375
They say that there's
a pretty strong barber on this island.

00:15:59.500 --> 00:16:01.250
Does anyone know where to find him?

00:16:02.083 --> 00:16:06.250
How did you know that I am
the strongest barber on this island?

00:16:09.000 --> 00:16:09.958
Not me.

00:16:10.041 --> 00:16:12.833
I'm Lei Yan, the Blaster Fist.

00:16:18.416 --> 00:16:21.250
SEVEN

00:16:24.666 --> 00:16:27.041
Tell all the killers

00:16:27.250 --> 00:16:31.458
that I'm returning to Xuanwu
to personally claim the head of the chief.

00:16:35.916 --> 00:16:39.083
I thought that guy is dead.

00:16:40.083 --> 00:16:41.250
That man...

00:16:42.208 --> 00:16:43.458
is coming back.

00:16:44.625 --> 00:16:45.750
ASSASSINATION REWARD

00:16:45.833 --> 00:16:47.250
CODE NAME: SEVEN
THE HIGHEST REWARD

00:16:52.000 --> 00:16:53.500
<i>I am Seven.</i>

00:16:53.583 --> 00:16:56.541
<i>Number 17,369 on the Killer Ranking List.</i>

00:16:57.208 --> 00:16:59.958
<i>I am the former senior hairstylist
at Dai Bo's salon.</i>

00:17:00.250 --> 00:17:02.625
<i>My constant quality service
and affordable prices</i>

00:17:02.708 --> 00:17:04.291
<i>made me the toast of the town.</i>

00:17:04.375 --> 00:17:05.541
WORLD MAP
CHICKEN ISLAND

00:17:05.625 --> 00:17:08.500
<i>But today, I'm leaving this island behind.</i>

00:17:12.416 --> 00:17:15.125
TEMPORARILY CLOSED
FOR STYLIST'S STUDYING ABROAD

00:17:19.625 --> 00:17:21.625
DAO FASHION

00:19:28.666 --> 00:19:29.833
Your Highness.

00:19:30.125 --> 00:19:31.666
The Energy Stone you retrieved

00:19:31.750 --> 00:19:34.458
has successfully activated
the robots that the King designed.

00:19:34.541 --> 00:19:36.708
But if we want to defeat Xuanwu,

00:19:37.875 --> 00:19:39.708
we need even more of this stone.

00:19:40.541 --> 00:19:43.166
Professor, is it possible...
